</component>
</requirement>

<p id="_ca88cfbc-8f23-2e19-a123-5599df262dcf">All the elements from the GeoSciML Extension package must pass the schematron rules defined in the schematron file located at link:http://schemas.opengis.net/gsml/4.1/geoSciMLExtension.schhttp://schemas.opengis.net/gsml/4.1/geoSciMLExtension.sch].</p>
