  <script>Latn</script>
  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">This standard defines low level data models for exchanging sensor related data between nodes of the OGC® Sensor Web Enablement (SWE) framework. These models allow applications and/or servers to structure, encode and transmit sensor datasets in a self describing and semantically enabled way.</abstract>
  
